---
_label: "CUE"
_icon: icon.sun
---

CUE is a constraint-based configuration language where types and values are unified into a single lattice. CUE makes validation intrinsic to the type system: constraining a value and checking its type are the same operation.

- Link: [cuelang.org](https://cuelang.org/docs/concept/the-logic-of-cue/)

